Chạy cả file sau, output là gì?

```python
def deco(f):
    print("deco", f.__name__)
    def wrapper(*args):
        return f(*args) + 1
    return wrapper

@deco
def g(x):
    return x * 10

print(g.__name__, g(2))
```

